    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "20 Beach Road, Photoh Rock, Carrigaline, Co. Cork is a bright and well-located three-bedroom semi-detached home presented in good condition and offering superb potential for the next owner to add their own style. Occupying a peaceful cul-de-sac position, the property benefits from a driveway, a spacious rear garden with a sunny aspect, and attractive open common ground alongside, creating a real sense of space and privacy. Built in 2003 and measuring approximately 96 sq. m., this home also offers excellent scope for a future extension to the rear, subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room, and kitchen/dining area with patio doors leading to the garden and shed, downstairs WC & WHB. Upstairs includes three bedrooms and a main bathroom. With gas heating, a C1 BER rating, and an asking price of €320,000, this is an appealing home in a sought-after setting."
      },
